## 4. Hooks Directory (`/home/arrafi/hooks/`)

### 4a. Synchronous Filesystem Read on Every Invocation

**File:** `ponytail-instructions.js` (line 82)
```javascript
filterSkillBodyForMode(fs.readFileSync(SKILL_PATH, 'utf8'), effectiveMode);
```

**Problem:** `getPonytailInstructions()` reads the full SKILL.md file from disk synchronously every time instructions are built, then filters it line-by-line (lines 21-35 of `filterSkillBodyForMode`). If this runs on every tool/hook invocation, it's wasted I/O.

**Fix:** Cache the file content and filter results:
```javascript
const skillBodyCache = new Map();

function getCachedSkillBody(mode) {
  if (skillBodyCache.has(mode)) return skillBodyCache.get(mode);
  const body = fs.readFileSync(SKILL_PATH, 'utf8');
  const filtered = filterSkillBodyForMode(body, mode);
  skillBodyCache.set(mode, filtered);
  return filtered;
}

// Invalidate cache when file changes (optional):
fs.watchFile(SKILL_PATH, () => skillBodyCache.clear());
```

